It also improved my ability to approach a business problem analytically, translate it into a machine learning solution and communicate the findings in a structured and professional manner.

**In conclusion, the project achieved its main objective of developing and evaluating a customer churn classification solution, with XGBoost emerging as the preferred model. It provided a valuable practical learning experience and demonstrated the potential of machine learning to support data-driven business decision-making.**

